                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2152e0f8-a691-42c1-b260-291eeb029b01",
                                                "sense_id": "134df279-47b0-3873-93cb-556de088f3af",
                                                "text": "At the same time, it is hoped that the close qualitative and quantitative examination will provide metalexicographers a model of analysis that may be profitably applied to other dictionaries."
